* {{IPA|de|/ˈzʏçtɪç/}} {{qualifier|standard}}
* {{audio|de|De-süchtig.ogg}}
* {{IPA|de|/ˈzʏçtɪk/}} {{qualifier|common form in southern Germany, Austria, and Switzerland}}
* {{audio|de|De-süchtig2.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|de|ʏçtɪç|ʏçtɪk|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|de|süch|tig}}

